# Soldier (ticket 43, from BattleRoyale ticket 04 at 80df274): a plain modern soldier, toon and chunky, rigged on the Synty skeleton in its T-pose rest.
# HEADLESS: no skull, hair, ears, nose, eyes, brows or jaw (the monster head of ticket 45 goes on head_top and the Head bone); the collar and neck stay. No helmet,
# no backpack part; the pack straps over the shoulders are part of the body. The skins are a vertex-colour remap of the olive base set (red and blue). Faces +Z, +X is the left. Built at real size, the soles on y = 0.
# Contracts: head_top at (0,1.815,0.015); vest back flat at z=-0.19; sockets head_top, back, chest, grip (hand_R), support (hand_L).
format 2
skeleton=synty
collider bones

